    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "Each component hits the dentry cache first; a miss calls the filesystem's i_op->lookup.",
      "narration": "For each component the kernel first tries the dentry cache, in RCU-walk mode without locks. Only a miss calls the filesystem's lookup method.",
